# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: The Monogrammed Sash (8552).
# The hearth is set in Ironforge on the training stop: the Searing Gorge guide starts with it (and the gryphon to
# Thelsamar), and the Burning Steppes guide hearths back there twice.
# Booty Bay at 48: Akiris by the Bundle (617), Zanzil's Secret (621), Voodoo Dues (609), The Bloodsail Buccaneers
# (604) and Stranglethorn Fever (348) are taken here and done on the Wild Shore, the coast north of the bay and in the
# gorilla hills: on 40-50/01's visit at 41 their pirates, naga, Zanzil's followers and Mokk were two and three levels
# over the player. Since the 0.4.3 route round 40-50/01 no longer takes the first four for this stop: carried from
# there through the Riverglades they held the quest log at 36.
# Blasted Lands (fix round 2026-11-20): Mazen's Behest (1364) and Deliver the Shipment (1425) are handed in at
# Nethergarde Keep on 40-50/01's swamp leg, so this guide no longer rides Darkshire -> Deadwind Pass -> the Swamp of
# Sorrows -> the Blasted Lands: Thadius Grimshade (2990) is taken here and handed in on the Burning Steppes guide's
# Nethergarde landing, the five bloodmage quests are taken on that guide's bloodmage camp stop where their beasts are
# hunted, and Supplies for Nethergarde (1395, an hour's crate from Darkshire) is left out. Stormwind flies straight to
# Booty Bay.

step The Altar of Zul
  when onquest 2989
  tip Ride south-east to the Altar of Zul, the stepped Vilebranch temple in the south of the Hinterlands, and climb to the top. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand up there: touch the top and come straight back down.
  tip Careful: Elite trolls guard the top platform, including Qiaga the Keeper and Morta'gya the Keeper, along with several Vilebranch Soothsayers. The soothsayers cast spells and are linked to the rest of the group.
  goto 49.0,68.7
  complete 2989 @49.0,68.7

step Vilebranch Soothsayers
  tip The Vilebranch Soothsayers (46-47) walk the ground around the foot of the Altar of Zul: their totems are for Maret Firetend, and more Vilebranch Totems lie on the ground among them: pick those up too. Careful: Qiaga the Keeper and Morta'gya the Keeper (50, elites) stand on the altar's south-east side: take the Soothsayers on its west side, away from them, and stay off the altar.
  collect 279225 quest 86616 @45.3,66.7 map 1425 -- Vilebranch Totem

step Skulk Rock
  tip Ride north to Skulk Rock in the middle of the Hinterlands. Green Sludges and Jade Oozes crawl all around it.
  tip Careful: Panthers move around the area in stealth.
  kill 2655 quest 2877                -- Green Sludge
  kill 2656 quest 2877                -- Jade Ooze

step OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon
  when has 8704
  tip Only with the distress beacon, a rare drop in the Hinterlands: it starts a quest to find the robot it calls for.
  accept 485 item 8704 optional       -- OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon

step OOX-09/HL
  when onquest 485
  tip The robot sits at the head of the river west of Skulk Rock. Escort it east to the shore beyond the Overlook Cliffs, then ride back west for Aerie Peak; its reward waits with Oglethorpe Obnoticus in Booty Bay, later in this guide.
  tip Careful: Two ambushes spawn during the escort: first three wildkin owlbeasts, then three trolls. Before each, the robot halts and announces it senses danger. Oozes, stealthed wolves and a large turtle along the path can join fights, and they respawn even if cleared beforehand.
  turnin 485 optional                 -- Homing Robot OOX-09/HL
  accept 836 optional
  complete 836 optional

step Wildkin feathers
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Erelas Ambersky's Wildkin Feathers lie on the ground across the Hinterlands, south and east of Aerie Peak, where the owlbeasts roam: pick them up as you ride between the altar and Skulk Rock.
  collect 10819 quest 3661                    -- Wildkin Feather

step Lost Gryphon Eggs
  tip On the way back to Aerie Peak: the lost gryphon eggs lie in the hills just east of the aviary.
  collect 279229 quest 86620 @16.5,50.0 map 1425 -- Lost Gryphon Egg

step Aerie Peak
  turnin 2881 direct optional -- Inside
  turnin 2877                         -- Fraggar Thundermantle
  turnin 2989                         -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe, inside
  accept 2990                         -- for Thadius Grimshade at Nethergarde Keep: the Burning Steppes guide hands it in
  turnin 86620                        -- Gryphon Master Talonaxe
  turnin 86616                        -- Farseer Maret Firetend, just east of the aviary

step Fly to Ironforge
  zone The Hinterlands
  goto 11.1,46.1 "Aerie Peak flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

