step Negolash's bait
  when group 8554
  tip Negolash comes only for his food: hand in Enticing Negolash at Captain Smotts' ruined lifeboat on the shore south-east of Booty Bay, with 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 Junglevine Wine, and he comes to the boat. Nixxrax Fillamug, the food and drink vendor at the inn, sells the wine. The wings are a cook's dish: if you don't cook, bring them from the Auction House.
  buy 4595 x5 npc 2832                 -- Junglevine Wine, Nixxrax Fillamug
  auction 4457 x10                     -- Barbecued Buzzard Wing: in your bags already if you cook
  turnin 619 direct                    -- Ruined Lifeboat: the food goes in, Negolash comes

